              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na we aramwishura, ati N’ umpangaze, jewe incoreke yawe. Maz’ uwo mugore arīgīra; araheza ararya, ntiyasubira kwiraburanirwa ukundi.",
          "type": "text",
