        {
          "text": "Bukeye barazinduka, baja imbere y’Uhoraho barasenga; bahejeje barataha, basubira i wabo i Rama. Maze Elukana arārira Hana umugore wiwe, Uhoraho aramwibuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
