          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Hana aravuga, ati Mwami wanje, indahiro ni wewe nyene, erega ni jewe wa mugore nari mpagaze i ruhande yawe, mwami wanje, nsaba Uhoraho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.26",
