              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni co gitumye ndamugize inkūka y’Uhoraho; azorinda apfa ar’ inkūka y’Uhoraho. Nuko basengera Uhoraho aho hantu.",
